{"id":"950ec2e4-a702-44bb-a4e9-af986078596e","createdAt":"2026-10-26T12:01:47.675Z","batchId":"login_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:420px; margin:4rem auto;\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:48px; height:48px; font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:700;\">AC</div>\n    <h1>Welcome back</h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Sign in to your account to continue</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <label>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Email address</span>\n        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" id=\"login-email\">\n      </label>\n      <span class=\"small\" id=\"email-error\" style=\"color:var(--destructive, #dc2626); display:none;\">Please enter a valid email address.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.25rem;\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Password</span>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"small btn-ghost\" style=\"padding:0; font-size:0.8rem; text-decoration:underline;\">Forgot password?</a>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;\">\n        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" id=\"login-password\" style=\"width:100%; padding-right:3rem;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"toggle-password\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0.25rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);\">Show</button>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"small\" id=\"password-error\" style=\"color:var(--destructive, #dc2626); display:none;\">Password must be at least 8 characters.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <label class=\"check\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember-me\">\n      <span class=\"small\">Remember me on this device</span>\n    </label>\n\n    <button class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"sign-in-btn\" onclick=\"handleSignIn()\">Sign in</button>\n\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"hr\" style=\"flex:1;\"></span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">or</span>\n      <span class=\"hr\" style=\"flex:1;\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Continue with Google</button>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:0;\">\n      Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Create one</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"alert alert-destructive stack gap-sm\" id=\"lockout-alert\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <span class=\"small\"><strong>Too many attempts.</strong> Your account has been temporarily locked. Try again in 15 minutes or reset your password.</span>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" style=\"align-self:flex-start; text-decoration:none;\">Reset password</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('toggle-password');\n  const passwordField = document.getElementById('login-password');\n\n  toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const isPassword = passwordField.type === 'password';\n    passwordField.type = isPassword ? 'text' : 'password';\n    toggleBtn.textContent = isPassword ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n  });\n\n  function handleSignIn() {\n    const email = document.getElementById('login-email').value;\n    const password = passwordField.value;\n    const emailError = document.getElementById('email-error');\n    const passwordError = document.getElementById('password-error');\n    const btn = document.getElementById('sign-in-btn');\n\n    emailError.style.display = 'none';\n    passwordError.style.display = 'none';\n\n    let valid = true;\n\n    if (!email || !email.includes('@') || !email.includes('.')) {\n      emailError.style.display = 'block';\n      valid = false;\n    }\n\n    if (password.length < 8) {\n      passwordError.style.display = 'block';\n      valid = false;\n    }\n\n    if (!valid) return;\n\n    btn.disabled = true;\n    btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n    btn.classList.add('btn-secondary');\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      btn.disabled = false;\n      btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      btn.classList.remove('btn-secondary');\n      document.getElementById('lockout-alert').style.display = 'block';\n    }, 1800);\n  }\n</script>","deltas":[[5792,"<div class"],[5792,"=\"stack"],[5923," gap-lg\" style"],[5932,"=\""],[5966,"max-width:4"],[5975,"20px;"],[6101," margin:4rem"],[6101," auto;\">\n"],[6185,"  <div class"],[6190,"=\"stack gap-sm"],[6222," center\">"],[6246,"\n    <div"],[6354," class=\"avatar\""],[6371," style=\"width"],[6371,":48px"],[6441,"; height:4"],[6453,"8"],[6623,"px; font-size"],[6628,":1"],[6628,".25rem"],[6680,"; font-weight"],[6680,":700"],[6801,";\">AC</div"],[6809,">\n"],[6809,"    <h1"],[6932,">Welcome back</h"],[6941,"1>"],[6985,"\n    <p"],[6993," class=\"muted"],[7152,"\">Sign in to"],[7163," your account"],[7210," to continue</p"],[7210,">\n "],[7244," </div>\n\n"],[7256,"  <div class"],[7372,"=\"card stack gap"],[7382,"-lg"],[7416,"\">\n    <"],[7503,"div class=\"stack"],[7513,"\">\n      <"],[7513,"label"],[7671,">\n        <"],[7754,"span class=\"small"],[7794," muted\">Email address"],[7806,"</"],[7806,"span>\n       "],[7911," <input type=\""],[7962,"email\" placeholder=\""],[7963,"name@"